| `shared modules return` | A module another project module imports raises or returns and never ends the process outside its entry block; `tests/integration/test_exit_gate.py` fails a `fail` or `finish` call there. | `make test` | [`import_layers.may_end_the_process`](settings.md#configprojectjson) | `passthrough` ends nothing and is allowed; it cannot see an exit reached through `getattr` or an uncaught exception. | [python-style.md](../guides/python-style.md) | always |
